<title>USA: Rush-Henrietta CSD, N.Y., won by Fleet.</title>
<headline>Rush-Henrietta CSD, N.Y., won by Fleet.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fleet Securities, Inc said it won $3.700 million of Rush-Henrietta Central School District, N.Y., school district bonds, 1996, with a net interest cost of 4.6454 percent.</p>
</text>
